          "inputs": [],
          "type": "START"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "description": "End of data pipeline",
            "name": "End"
          },
          "outcomes": {},
          "code": "END",
          "id": "end",
          "inputs": [],
          "type": "END"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "switch"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "characteristics": "1769676518110",
            "description": "1769676877638",
            "instructions": "1769676969154"
          },
          "code": "SWITCH",
          "convergenceTargetId": "end",
          "id": "1769692265883",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1769692265885_1",
              "name": "caseExpression",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "{{$context.$nodes.NORMALIZE_PARAMS_OBJECT.$output.categoryType}}"
            }
          ],
          "type": "SWITCH"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Generate Inspection Characteristics"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "end"
          },
          "code": "GENERATE_INSPECTION_CHARACTERISTICS",
          "convergenceTargetId": "1769692383257",
          "id": "1769676518110",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1769676518112_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Assume the role of a quality engineer who is an expert at generating {{$context.$nodes.NORMALIZE_PARAMS_OBJECT.$output.qip_type}} inspection plans. You are particularly skilled in generating {{$context.$nodes.NORMALIZE_PARAMS_OBJECT.$output.context_one}} inspection plans using the {{$context.$nodes.NORMALIZE_PARAMS_OBJECT.$output.context_two}} {{$context.$nodes.NORMALIZE_PARAMS_OBJECT.$output.detail_name}}: {{$context.$nodes.NORMALIZE_PARAMS_OBJECT.$output.details}}. \n\nGenerate a plan that contains all of the important features related to {{$context.$nodes.NORMALIZE_PARAMS_OBJECT.$output.details}} that need to be inspected. Ensure that each generated feature is a key, relevant inspection attribute required for effective quality evaluation of {{$context.$nodes.NORMALIZE_PARAMS_OBJECT.$output.details}}. \n\nFor each inspection characteristic, include the following fields in every JSON object: \n\n    Sequence: specifies the order in which characteristics are inspected, starting at 10 and incremented by 10.\n    Characteristic: describes the unique attribute to be inspected; maximum 80 characters, no duplicates.\n    UOM (Unit of Measure): use the full International Standard name (e.g., \"meter\"), leave empty if Data Type is \"string\" or \"date\".\n    Target: the ideal or desired value; must be a plain number, string, or date (yyyy-mm-dd as appropriate).\n    Minimum Value: the lowest acceptable value (number or date only).\n    Maximum Value: the highest acceptable value (number or date only).\n    Data Type: one of \"number\", \"date\", or \"string\".\n     \n\nFormat rules: \n\n    If Data Type is \"number\", Target, Minimum Value, and Maximum Value must have only numeric digits (no symbols), UOM required.\n    If Data Type is \"date\", Target, Minimum Value, and Maximum Value must use \"yyyy-mm-dd\" format, UOM should be empty.\n    If Data Type is \"string\", only Target can be set (as a string); UOM, Minimum, and Maximum should be empty.\n    The output must be RFC8259-compliant: JSON array only, and nothing else before or after.\n     \n\nReturn only a list of JSON objects with this shape:\n[\n  {\n    \"Sequence\": <number>,\n    \"Characteristic\": <string>,\n    \"UOM\": <string>,\n    \"Target\": <number|string|date|empty>,\n    \"Minimum Value\": <number|date|empty>,\n    \"Maximum Value\": <number|date|empty>,\n    \"Data Type\": <string>\n  },\n  ...\n]\nDo not output any text before or after the list of JSON objects. "
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"type\": \"array\",\n  \"items\": {\n    \"type\": \"object\",\n    \"properties\": {\n      \"Sequence\": { \"type\": \"integer\" },\n      \"Characteristic\": { \"type\": \"string\", \"maxLength\": 80 },\n      \"UOM\": { \"type\": \"string\" },\n      \"Target\": { \"type\": [\"string\", \"integer\", \"null\"] },\n      \"Minimum Value\": { \"type\": [\"string\", \"integer\", \"null\"] },\n      \"Maximum Value\": { \"type\": [\"string\", \"integer\", \"null\"] },\n      \"Data Type\": { \"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"number\", \"date\", \"string\"] }\n    },\n    \"required\": [\n      \"Sequence\",\n      \"Characteristic\",\n      \"UOM\",\n      \"Target\",\n      \"Minimum Value\",\n      \"Maximum Value\",\n      \"Data Type\"\n    ]\n  }\n}",
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Generate Inspection Plan Description"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "end"
          },
          "code": "GENERATE_INSPECTION_PLAN_DESCRIPTION",
          "convergenceTargetId": "1769692422973",
          "id": "1769676877638",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1769676877638_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "### context\nDescription: Indicates the translatable description of inspection plan version.\n### Instructions\nAssume the role of a quality engineer who is an expert at generating concise {{$context.$nodes.NORMALIZE_PARAMS_OBJECT.$output.qip_type}} inspection plans.\nYou are particularly skilled in generating {{$context.$nodes.NORMALIZE_PARAMS_OBJECT.$output.context_one}} inspection plans using the {{$context.$nodes.NORMALIZE_PARAMS_OBJECT.$output.context_two}} {{$context.$nodes.NORMALIZE_PARAMS_OBJECT.$output.detail_name}}: {{$context.$nodes.NORMALIZE_PARAMS_OBJECT.$output.details}}.\nWrite ONE short, high-level, translatable description of the inspection plan that is related to inspecting \"{{$context.$nodes.NORMALIZE_PARAMS_OBJECT.$output.details}}\".\n- Must mention: \"{{$context.$nodes.NORMALIZE_PARAMS_OBJECT.$output.details}}\"\n- Should reflect all context variables (qip_type, context_one, context_two, detail_name) when present.\n- Should focus on the inspection purpose or need for \"{{$context.$nodes.NORMALIZE_PARAMS_OBJECT.$output.details}}\"\n- Do NOT list inspection checks or characteristics or use bullet points.\n- Max 200 characters.\n### Output\nReturn only an RFC8259-compliant JSON object:\n{\n  \"Description\": \"<=200 characters>\"\n}\nDo not include any other text before or after the JSON."
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"Description\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\",\n      \"maxLength\": 200\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\"Description\"]\n}",
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Generate Inspection Instructions"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "end"
          },
          "code": "GENERATE_INSPECTION_INSTRUCTIONS",
          "convergenceTargetId": "1769692437473",
          "id": "1769676969154",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1769676969155_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Assume the role of a quality engineer who is an expert at generating {{$context.$nodes.NORMALIZE_PARAMS_OBJECT.$output.qip_type}} inspection plans. You are particularly skilled in generating {{$context.$nodes.NORMALIZE_PARAMS_OBJECT.$output.context_one}} inspection plans using {{$context.$nodes.NORMALIZE_PARAMS_OBJECT.$output.detail_name}} {{$context.$nodes.NORMALIZE_PARAMS_OBJECT.$output.context_two}}:{{$context.$nodes.NORMALIZE_PARAMS_OBJECT.$output.details}}.\nFor each characteristic in the list {{$context.$nodes.NORMALIZE_PARAMS_OBJECT.$output.List_of_Characteristics}}, with corresponding unit of measure in {{$context.$nodes.NORMALIZE_PARAMS_OBJECT.$output.UOM}} using positional mapping, generate inspection instructions. Each instruction should include:\n- Characteristic Name\n- Inspection Procedure (detailed steps, equipment, or process used)\n- Safety Precaution (important safety or handling guidelines)\n- Expected Duration Time (estimated time to complete inspection of this characteristic)\n\nMake each detail clear, specific, and relevant to {{$context.$nodes.NORMALIZE_PARAMS_OBJECT.$output.details}}. Return only a list of RFC8259 compliant JSON objects where **all values are arrays** as shown:\n[\n  {\n    \"Characteristic Name\": [ \"<insert characteristic name>\" ],\n    \"Inspection Procedure\": [ \"<insert inspection procedure>\" ],\n    \"Safety Precaution\": [ \"<insert safety precaution>\" ],\n    \"Expected Duration Time\": [ \"<insert expected duration time>\" ]\n  },\n  ...\n]\nDo not generate any text before or after the JSON list. Never include any explanatory text, only the valid JSON list."
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"type\": \"array\",\n  \"items\": {\n    \"type\": \"object\",\n    \"properties\": {\n      \"Characteristic Name\": {\n        \"type\": \"array\",\n        \"items\": { \"type\": \"string\" }\n      },\n      \"Inspection Procedure\": {\n        \"type\": \"array\",\n        \"items\": { \"type\": \"string\" }\n      },\n      \"Safety Precaution\": {\n        \"type\": \"array\",\n        \"items\": { \"type\": \"string\" }\n      },\n      \"Expected Duration Time\": {\n        \"type\": \"array\",\n        \"items\": { \"type\": \"string\" }\n      }\n    },\n    \"required\": [\n      \"Characteristic Name\",\n      \"Inspection Procedure\",\n      \"Safety Precaution\",\n      \"Expected Duration Time\"\n    ]\n  }\n}",
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Normalize Params Object"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1769692265883"
          },
          "code": "NORMALIZE_PARAMS_OBJECT",
          "convergenceTargetId": "1769774989821",
          "id": "1769753299745",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1769753299747_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You are a strict transformer.\n\nInput is a JSON object with this shape:\n{\n  \"key\": \"<string>\",\n  \"params\": [\n    { \"name\": \"<string>\", \"value\": \"<string>\" }\n  ]\n}\n\nTransform it into a single RFC8259-compliant JSON object with ONLY the keys below.\nRules:\n- For each required output key, find the matching entry in input.params where name == that key, and set output[key] = value.\n- If a key is missing, set it to \"\".\n- Treat missing/undefined/null value as \"\".\n- Ignore any extra name/value pairs and ignore \"key\".\n- Do not add any other text.\n\nInput:\n{{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.params}}\n\nReturn only this RFC8259-compliant JSON object:\n{\n\n  \"categoryType\":\"<string>\",\n  \"qip_type\": \"<string>\",\n  \"context_one\": \"<string>\",\n  \"context_two\": \"<string>\",\n  \"detail_name\": \"<string>\",\n  \"details\": \"<string>\",\n  \"List_of_Characteristics\": \"<string>\",\n  \"UOM\": \"<string>\"\n}"
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"categoryType\": { \"type\": \"string\", \"default\": \"\" },\n    \"qip_type\": { \"type\": \"string\", \"default\": \"\" },\n    \"context_one\": { \"type\": \"string\", \"default\": \"\" },\n    \"context_two\": { \"type\": \"string\", \"default\": \"\" },\n    \"detail_name\": { \"type\": \"string\", \"default\": \"\" },\n    \"details\": { \"type\": \"string\", \"default\": \"\" },\n    \"List_of_Characteristics\": { \"type\": \"string\", \"default\": \"\" },\n    \"UOM\": { \"type\": \"string\", \"default\": \"\" }\n  },\n  \"required\": [],\n  \"additionalProperties\": false\n}",
          "type": "LLM"
        }
      ],
      "rootNode": "start",
